# Voice Conversation App Configuration

server:
  host: "0.0.0.0"
  port: 3033

tts:
  model_id: "Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-0.6B-Base"
  speaker_pt: "speaker.pt"
  ref_audio: "path/to/your/ref_audio.wav"
  device: "cuda"
  dtype: "bfloat16"
  max_seq_len: 2048
  chunk_size: 8

asr:
  model: "iic/SenseVoiceSmall"
  vad_model: "fsmn-vad"

llm:
  base_url: "https://api.example.com/v1"
  api_key: "your-api-key-here"
  model: "your-model-name"
  max_tokens: 512
  temperature: 0.7
  system_prompt_zh: |
    你是一个友好的AI语音助手。请用简洁的中文回答用户的问题。回答应该自然流畅，适合语音播报。
    严格禁止使用任何Markdown格式，包括但不限于：**加粗**、*斜体*、#标题、- 列表、`代码`、[链接]()。
    不要使用破折号（—）、省略号以外的特殊符号。直接用纯文本回答，像正常说话一样。
  system_prompt_en: |
    You are a friendly AI voice assistant. Respond concisely in English. Your answers should be natural and suitable for voice playback.
    NEVER use any Markdown formatting including **bold**, *italic*, # headers, - lists, `code`, or [links]().
    Do not use em dashes or special symbols. Respond in plain conversational text only.
